      "filename": "Curaçao - Queen Emma Bridge (3899163060).jpg",
      "caption": "Queen Emma bridge in Willemstad was opened in 1888.  It is a pontoon bridge across St. Anna Bay, and swings open to let ships enter and leave.  I took this photo at the Punda (east) end of the bridge, in the city center.  The bridge is supposed to be for pedestrians.  I guess that some privileged vehicles are able to use it.",
